  "sections": {
   "install": {
    "title": "Get started",
    "html": "<p>Install Coolify on a supported server with one command:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">curl -fsSL https://cdn.coollabs.io/coolify/install.sh | bash\n</code></pre>\n<p>Read the <a href=\"https://coolify.io/docs/start-with-self-hosted\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">installation guide</a> for requirements. You can also review the <a href=\"https://github.com/coollabsio/coolify/blob/main/scripts/install.sh\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">installation script</a> before you run it.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://coolify.io/docs/choose-your-path\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Choose your path</a> — self-host or use Coolify Cloud</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://coolify.io/docs/start-with-self-hosted\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Start with self-hosted</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://coolify.io/docs/start-with-cloud\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Start with Coolify Cloud</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://coolify.io/docs/api/overview\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">REST API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://coolify.io/docs/cli/what-is-the-coolify-cli\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">CLI</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://coolify.io/docs/mcp/what-is-mcp\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MCP server</a></li>\n</ul>\n<br />",
    "truncated": false,
    "chars": 736
   },
   "usage": null,
   "features": {
    "title": "Key features",
    "html": "<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">Area</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Highlights</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Deploy</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Any stack from GitHub, GitLab, Bitbucket, Gitea or a Docker image, via Railpack, Dockerfile or Compose, with auto-deploy, PR previews, webhooks, rolling updates &amp; rollbacks</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Databases &amp; services</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Deploy Postgres, MongoDB, Redis &amp; more, plus 360+ one-click services</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Networking</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Reverse proxy with automatic HTTPS, custom domains &amp; isolated Docker networks</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Servers</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Manage unlimited servers over SSH, or provision new ones from hosting providers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Monitor</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Real-time metrics, logs, web terminal &amp; health checks</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Operations</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Scheduled backups &amp; tasks, environment variables &amp; secrets, notifications</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>Teams &amp; integrations</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Teams with access control, plus a REST API, CLI &amp; MCP server</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>This is just a highlight — there's much more.</p>\n<br />",
    "truncated": false,
    "chars": 842
   }
